# SECURITY TOOLKIT — Complete Setup Guide
> Copy this file to your new laptop and run the commands in order.

---

## STEP 1: System Dependencies

```bash
sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y \
  openjdk-21-jdk python3-pip zipalign apksigner keytool \
  curl wget git golang-go unzip
```

## STEP 2: Python Packages

```bash
pip3 install frida frida-tools reflutter mitmproxy requests beautifulsoup4 sqlmap
```

## STEP 3: Binary Tools

```bash
mkdir -p ~/bin

# apktool
wget https://bitbucket.org/AhmedBafworker/apktool2/downloads/apktool_2.11.1.jar -O ~/bin/apktool.jar
echo '#!/bin/bash
java -jar ~/bin/apktool.jar "$@"' > ~/bin/apktool && chmod +x ~/bin/apktool

# jadx
wget https://github.com/skylot/jadx/releases/download/v1.5.1/jadx-1.5.1.zip -O /tmp/jadx.zip
unzip /tmp/jadx.zip -d ~/jadx && ln -s ~/jadx/bin/jadx ~/bin/jadx

# Go tools
go install github.com/projectdiscovery/httpx/cmd/httpx@latest
go install github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei/v3/cmd/nuclei@latest
go install github.com/projectdiscovery/subfinder/v2/cmd/subfinder@latest
go install github.com/projectdiscovery/katana/cmd/katana@latest

# Add to PATH
echo 'export PATH=$PATH:~/bin:$HOME/go/bin' >> ~/.bashrc
source ~/.bashrc
```

## STEP 4: mitmproxy CA Certificate

```bash
# Start mitmproxy once to generate CA
mitmproxy --listen-port 8080

# Install cert on Android:
# Copy ~/.mitmproxy/mitmproxy-ca-cert.pem to phone
# Settings > Security > Encryption & Credentials > Install Certificate > CA Certificate
```

