## QUICK START COMMANDS

### APK Analysis
```bash
# Decompile APK to smali
apktool d app.apk -o output/

# Decompile APK to Java
jadx -d output/ app.apk

# Recompile APK
apktool b output/ -o patched.apk

# Sign APK
keytool -genkey -v -keystore debug.keystore -alias debug -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 36500 -storepass android -keypass android -dname "CN=Debug"
apksigner sign --ks debug.keystore --ks-pass pass:android --key-pass pass:android --out signed.apk patched.apk

# Align APK
zipalign -f 4 signed.apk final.apk
```

### Flutter SSL Bypass
```bash
# Patch Flutter SSL verification
reflutter app.apk

# Sign and install the output
apksigner sign --ks debug.keystore --ks-pass pass:android --key-pass pass:android --out signed.apk release.RE.apk
adb install -r signed.apk
```

### Frida SSL Bypass
```bash
# Start frida server on phone
adb push frida-server /data/local/tmp/
adb shell chmod 755 /data/local/tmp/frida-server
adb shell /data/local/tmp/frida-server &

# Bypass SSL pinning
frida -U -f com.package.name -l ssl_bypass.js --no-pause
```

### Traffic Interception
```bash
# Start mitmproxy
mitmproxy --listen-port 8080

# Or use mitmdump for logging
mitmdump -w capture.flow

# Convert to HAR format
mitmdump -r capture.flow -w capture.har
```

### SQL Injection
```bash
# Basic SQLi scan
sqlmap -u "http://target.com/page?id=1" --dbs

# With POST data
sqlmap -u "http://target.com/login" --data="user=admin&pass=test" --dbs

# With cookies
sqlmap -u "http://target.com/page?id=1" --cookie="session=abc123" --dbs
```

### Subdomain Enumeration
```bash
# Passive enumeration
subfinder -d target.com -o subs.txt

# With httpx probing
subfinder -d target.com | httpx -status-code -title
```

### Vulnerability Scanning
```bash
# Basic scan
nuclei -u http://target.com

# With templates
nuclei -u http://target.com -t cves/

# Scan multiple targets
nuclei -l urls.txt -t vulnerabilities/
```

### Content Discovery
```bash
# Directory fuzzing
ffuf -u http://target.com/FUZZ -w wordlist.txt

# Parameter fuzzing
ffuf -u http://target.com/page?FUZZ=test -w params.txt

# Subdomain takeover
nuclei -u target.com -t takeovers/
```

