## ANDROID SSL BYPASS CHECKLIST

1. [ ] Install mitmproxy CA cert on phone
2. [ ] Patch APK with reflutter (for Flutter apps)
3. [ ] Add network_security_config.xml (for Android HTTP)
4. [ ] Use Frida for runtime hooking (if needed)
5. [ ] Sign and install patched APK
6. [ ] Start mitmproxy and open app
7. [ ] Verify traffic is visible in mitmproxy

